---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="P6｜Investment Matrix">

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="page-hero-inner">
    <div class="kicker">VOL.01 · P6 · INVESTMENT MATRIX</div>
    <h1>技術節點如何轉換成產業觀察？</h1>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">

  <div class="grid">

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">PROCESS</span>
      <h3>先進製程</h3>
      <p>製程節點、產能、設備與材料需求。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">PACKAGING</span>
      <h3>先進封裝</h3>
      <p>CoWoS、SoIC、Chiplet 與異質整合。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">OPTICAL</span>
      <h3>光互連</h3>
      <p>CPO、光引擎、光纖與高速互連。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">MATERIALS</span>
      <h3>材料與設備</h3>
      <p>尋找真正進入製程、驗證與量產的供應商。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">INFRASTRUCTURE</span>
      <h3>電力與散熱</h3>
      <p>AI Server 與資料中心基礎設施瓶頸。</p>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <span class="tag">SYSTEM</span>
      <h3>AI Platform</h3>
      <p>效能、功耗與成本的系統級觀察。</p>
    </article>

  </div>

</section>

<section class="page-nav">
  <a href="/research/vol01/p5">← P5</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01">Vol.01 Index</a>
  <a href="/research/vol01/p7">P7 →</a>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
